    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 导言：稍纵即逝的窗口</span></p><p><span>（一）起源：三思而后行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="164">02:44</a> 1.1 思维链雏形：让我们一步一步想</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 1.2 OpenAI o1 &amp; 理解AI的窗口</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> 1.3 DeepSeek R1 &amp; 过程监督vs结果监督</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 1.4 提纯vs扩展</span></p><p><span>（二）蒸馏：他山之石</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> 2.1 思维链蒸馏：越级挑战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> 2.2 攻防战升级：三十六计</span></p><p><span>（三）忠实度：知人知面不知心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a> 3.1 冰山一角</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2256">37:36</a> 3.2 解释与内部算法不一致</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2609">43:29</a> 3.3 隐藏、伪装、测试意识</span></p><p><span>（四）窗口关闭：得意忘言</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3205">53:25</a> 4.1 语言漂移</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3659">1:00:59</a> 4.2 循环深度</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4261">01:11:01</a> 尾声：智能规律会走多远</span></p>]]></description>
